"For Part {#}, graph the Capacitor voltage against Time, one curve for each capacitor. What voltage does it approach, and why? Check the energy balance in the last row for each capacitor: does From your hand equal the sum of the four energy columns after it? What fraction of the energy from your hand ends up in the capacitor? Where does the rest go?",
